From a59c77d100d6ee4c80ae828e3a5dbcd06a26bfb4 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Sat, 3 Oct 2026 01:11:55 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] fix: price lookup returns a quote only for the symbol asked
 for

get_best_bid_ask_last no longer falls back to the snapshot's venue-level row,
which holds whichever symbol the publisher fetched first. Symbols are matched
with the publisher's spelling rule. A failed exchange fetch in the paper
engine's price lookup returns no price.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
